{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38888","headline":"赠元上人 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠元上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多少僧中僧行高，偈成流落遍僧抄。\n经窗月静滩声到，石迳人稀藓色交。\n垂露竹黏蝉落壳，窣云松载鹤栖巢。\n煮茶童子闲胜我，犹得依时把磬敲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}